    <!-- App usage instructions -->
    <string name="app_usage_instructions">
        <b>Tixly</b> - your personal ticket storage assistant.\n\n
        🎫 ADDING TICKETS:\n
        • Tap ➕ at the bottom of the screen\n
        • Select PDF file or ticket image by tapping 🔄\n
        • Preview ticket file - 👁\n
        • Fill in the title, venue and event date\n
        • Tap 💾 to save\n\n
        📤 QUICK ADDING FROM FILE:\n
        • Open ticket image in any app\n
        • Tap the "Share" button\n
        • Select "Tixly" from the apps list\n
        • Ticket will open for editing\n
        • Fill in the title, venue and event date\n
        • Tap 💾 to save\n\n
        📱 VIEWING AND EDITING TICKETS:\n
        • 🖊️ - edit ticket\n
        • 👁 - view ticket file\n\n
        📋 COPYING TICKETS:\n
        • Tap ⊕ on a ticket\n
        • Title, venue and event date will be copied\n
        • Select new ticket file for copy - 🔄\n
        • Tap 💾 to save\n\n
        🔔 REMINDERS:\n
        • Enable reminders in settings\n
        • Choose notification time (from 1 hour to 1 week)\n
        • Receive reminders about upcoming events\n\n
        📱 ADDITIONAL FEATURES:\n
        • Edit tickets by tapping on them\n
        • Change the app language in the settings\n
        • Disable ads for more comfort
    </string>

